    "title": "SA8x97P GPU Virtualization",
    "subtitle": "Linux PVM backend, Android GVM drivers and shared DBCQ submission",
    "description": "SA8397P and SA8797P share the illustrated software framework. PVM services handle GPU control RPC over HAB and VirtIO. Guest drivers write HFI descriptors into shared DBCQ memory and signal mapped doorbell registers. GMU firmware schedules work; CP and SQE fetch indirect buffers. This overview does not specify the number of physical GPU instances.",
